<article class="mini-story"><img alt="Students learning" src="/assets/images/lex360/lex-lexicore-mi.webp"/><div><b>Multiple Intelligence</b><p><strong>Different ways to learn.</strong><br/>Children explore concepts through multiple approaches, helping them discover their strengths.</p></div></article>
